{"2999040": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Times of Survival", "steam_appid": 2999040, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999040/extras/a74eb316f159cadffbe6da25f155f0b6.avif?t=1779137842\" width=1539 height=576 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999040/extras/f6865fe8f92c5ebccd0f68e2643633f0.avif?t=1779137842\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999040/extras_big/f6865fe8f92c5ebccd0f68e2643633f0.webp?t=1779137842 width=1560 height=164 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Times of Survival</strong> - a co-op survival game where every run is a choice between scavenging deeper, saving lives, or making it back to base alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an unforgiving open world, loot realistic interiors, haul supplies home, and fortify your base - because the next attack doesn’t care if you’re ready.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don’t miss <strong>release</strong> date! <strong><i>Wishlist now!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999040/extras/b92c57addea8555dbfef1eddf565469e.poster.avif?t=1779137842\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999040/extras/b92c57addea8555dbfef1eddf565469e.webm?t=1779137842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999040/extras/b92c57addea8555dbfef1eddf565469e.mp4?t=1779137842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999040/extras/e0f191872b7ae8597d478408dacc0a8b.avif?t=1779137842\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999040/extras_big/e0f191872b7ae8597d478408dacc0a8b.webp?t=1779137842 width=1560 height=164 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Co-op  (Up to 8 Players)</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Squad up, coordinate roles, and revive teammates. Multiplayer is a core pillar and fully playable in the latest demo build. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Player progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Rescue Survivors &amp; Grow Your Base Find, extract, and bring survivors home. Every rescue expands your base, unlocking new crafting/defense options and raising the stakes for defense. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Open-world</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Open-World Scavenging With Real Interiors Enter houses, search every interior, and make constant risk-vs-reward calls. Loot isn’t just &quot;outside&quot; anymore. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Base Building</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Base Building &amp; Defense Loop Haul supplies back, build and fortify your shelter, and prepare for the siege. The world won’t wait until you’re ready. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survival classic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Survival Pressure Systems Survival classic: manage hunger, thirst, and fatigue while gathering resources that feed crafting and base upgrades.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >    <strong>Tactical Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Loud, Smart, or Silent Stealth takedowns, line-of-sight play, and a reactive aggro system based on vision, noise, and damage. Mistakes get punished fast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999040/extras/73f7d0ea3e6be91f97b6a39c510a03e6.poster.avif?t=1779137842\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999040/extras/73f7d0ea3e6be91f97b6a39c510a03e6.webm?t=1779137842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999040/extras/73f7d0ea3e6be91f97b6a39c510a03e6.mp4?t=1779137842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999040/extras/1824aee15b83fca4c78953445b40ac20.avif?t=1779137842\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999040/extras_big/1824aee15b83fca4c78953445b40ac20.webp?t=1779137842 width=1560 height=164 /></span>Built With the Community</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We ship in public, iterate quickly, and listen to feedback. If you play the demo and something feels off, feel free to tell us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist now</strong> to follow development and join the next tests!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999040/extras/031c4dc6d10106460b6fa4d68b57ff23.avif?t=1779137842\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999040/extras_big/031c4dc6d10106460b6fa4d68b57ff23.webp?t=1779137842 width=1560 height=847 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999040/extras/a74eb316f159cadffbe6da25f155f0b6.avif?t=1779137842\" width=15